  "description": "The meme draws from a long history of racist caricatures and pseudoscientific claims that have been used to justify slavery, segregation, and systemic racism. The comparison of Black people to monkeys is not a neutral observation but a historically rooted and offensive trope that has been used to deny Black humanity and justify oppression.",
